## Utility Types (Use These Patterns)

```typescript
// Partial update — don't pass fields you don't want to update
type UpdateProfile = Partial<Pick<Profile, 'displayName' | 'bio' | 'avatarUrl'>>;

// Read-only collections — prevent accidental mutation
type ScoreList = Readonly<GameScore[]>;

// Discriminated union for async state
type AsyncState<T> =
  | { status: 'idle' }
  | { status: 'loading' }
  | { status: 'success'; data: T }
  | { status: 'error'; message: string };

// Use for any Supabase-fetched data in components
```

