## No-Any Policy

```typescript
// ❌ Wrong — any breaks type safety
const data: any = await fetchProfile();
data.anything; // No error — completely unsafe

// ✅ Correct — use unknown and narrow
const result: unknown = await fetchProfile();
if (isProfile(result)) {
  result.displayName; // Safe — TypeScript confirmed the shape
}

// ✅ Correct — use generated Supabase types
const { data } = await supabase.from('profiles').select('*').single();
// data is fully typed — no any needed
```

